# Dev auto-reload

After making code changes to KAE (especially `apps/desktop` or `packages/*`):

1. Restart the dev server if it is not running or if package builds changed.
2. Use `npm run dev` from the repo root (rebuilds packages, then starts Vite + Electron).
3. The Electron window should hot-reload on save; if it looks stale, reload once manually.

When restarting dev, kill any existing process on port 5173 first, then start fresh.
